### Create a pharmacy

POST http://localhost:5000/api/pharmacies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PharmaLink Test Pharmacy",
  "address": "Cebu City, Philippines",
  "contact_number": "09123456789",
  "email": "test@pharmalink.com"
}


### Update pharmacy

PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/pharmacies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact_number": "09987654321"
}


### Test invalid pharmacy - missing name

POST http://localhost:5000/api/pharmacies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "address": "Cebu City, Philippines",
  "contact_number": "09123456789",
  "email": "invalid-test@pharmalink.com"
}

